- [ ] Migration or runtime mapping layer in the backend
- [ ] Update sync/backfill to write normalized names

### 2.2 Fantasy scoring
- [ ] Define scoring formula (standard, PPR, or configurable)
- [ ] Populate `total_points` during sync and backfill
- [ ] Add scoring configuration to the API response or as a separate endpoint

### 2.3 Bye weeks
- [ ] Fetch bye week data from ESPN schedule endpoints
- [ ] Populate `bye_week` column on `nfl_teams`

